Third-party components:

- The firmware in firmware/jtalm_action is built with ESP-IDF (Apache-2.0) and links M5Unified
  and M5GFX (MIT, Copyright (c) 2021 M5Stack), newlib, FreeRTOS (MIT) and a font from
  Adafruit GFX (BSD). Their license texts are in firmware/jtalm_action/licenses/.
- firmware/baselines/esp32_llm/cores3.patch modifies doryiii/esp32-llm (MIT); the patch
  context lines are upstream code under its MIT license.
- runtime/host/tokenizer.c is written to behave like SentencePiece 0.2 (unigram encoding,
  byte fallback). The normalization table stored in tokenizer.model and .jtlm files is
  SentencePiece's nmt_nfkc table (SentencePiece is Apache-2.0, Copyright Google LLC).
